  "body": "This is an attempt to give guidance and examples for a common area of difficulty we've seen for spec authors. It is inspired directly by conversations with @equalsJeffH in IRC and in https://github.com/w3c/webauthn/issues/472, although that's only the latest in a string of conversations. Other people I remember who might appreciate this: @jyasskin, @tobie.\r\n\r\n@bzbarsky, would you mind reviewing this? Suggestions on things to add or cut welcome. @annevk would also be a great reviewer, but he's still on vacation for some time, so maybe after he gets back.\r\n\r\n[Preview version](https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/20140634/event-loop-for-spec-authors/multipage/webappapis.html#event-loop-for-spec-authors)",
